   that model an expert's thinking process, has strained research attempts
   to integrate Decision Support Systems (DSS) with Knowledge Systems (KS)
   and multimedia in the direction of the development of knowledge-based
   DSS. The authors of this paper participated in the programme Framework 6
   project BRITA in PuBs. One of the project's goals was to develop a
   Building Refurbishment Knowledge-based Decision Support System
   (BR-KDSS). In order to demonstrate the integration of knowledge and DSS,
   a BR-KDSS will be considered as an example.},
