Abstract = {Multiple Criteria Decision Aiding (MCDA) is a domain focused on the
   development of methods to help decision makers. DECSPACE is an online
   Decision Support System (DSS) intended to be a workbench for the use of
   MCDA methods. DECSPACE supports projects as persistent spaces where
   users can explore different solutions for the same problem, and share
   those solutions in other projects. It is made available as an online
   service, and it can use methods implemented in a local server, as part
   of the local application, or methods available from remote web services.
   This paper describes DECSPACE as a DSS suited for use in teaching,
   researching, or for professional use in engineering and management.},
