   Int Journal Web Serv Res; Comp Now; IEEE Transact Serv Comp; Comp Cloud;
   Serv Comp},
Abstract = {QoS-based service rating has made positive contributions to the area of
   service selection. Especially for Cloud service users, the right
   decision when choosing suitable Cloud services can help them improve
   user satisfaction and trading revenues. This work aims to address the
   issue of uncertainty in service requests, service descriptions, user and
   expert preferences, as well as evaluation criteria in a MCDM-based
   service selection procedure. A hybrid fuzzy framework for Cloud service
   selection is proposed, addressing the challenge using three approaches:
   a fuzzy-ontology-based approach for function matching and service
   filtering; a fuzzy AHP technique for informed criterion weighting; and,
   a fuzzy TOPSIS approach for service ranking.},
